{"vid":"7pjj3x7rfPg","source":"7pjj3x7rfPg.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Here's a tip for restarting 718 rods"},{"t":2.6,"txt":"when you're stick welding. So 718 is one"},{"t":5.5,"txt":"of my favorite electrodes to run, but it"},{"t":7.3,"txt":"didn't take me long to realize that they"},{"t":8.9,"txt":"can be kind of difficult to restart. And"},{"t":11,"txt":"one of the reasons for that is this slag"},{"t":13.1,"txt":"that can stick to the end right here"},{"t":14.6,"txt":"that doesn't really crunch off with a"},{"t":16,"txt":"glove. Usually you need a file or you"},{"t":18.2,"txt":"can beat it on your workpiece or uh"},{"t":20.6,"txt":"something else. But if you just flick"},{"t":21.9,"txt":"your rod like that at the end of the"},{"t":23.8,"txt":"weld, it'll fling that slag off of the"},{"t":26.8,"txt":"end and leave you with just a little bit"},{"t":28.9,"txt":"of flux. that you can crunch with your"},{"t":30.3,"txt":"glove to expose bare metal and then"},{"t":32.7,"txt":"it'll start right up."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"Here's"},{"t":0.4,"w":"a"},{"t":0.56,"w":"tip"},{"t":0.719,"w":"for"},{"t":0.96,"w":"restarting"},{"t":1.52,"w":"718"},{"t":2.24,"w":"rods"},{"t":2.56,"w":"when"},{"t":2.72,"w":"you're"},{"t":2.879,"w":"stick"},{"t":3.12,"w":"welding."},{"t":3.76,"w":"So"},{"t":4.24,"w":"718"},{"t":5.12,"w":"is"},{"t":5.359,"w":"one"},{"t":5.52,"w":"of"},{"t":5.6,"w":"my"},{"t":5.839,"w":"favorite"},{"t":6.08,"w":"electrodes"},{"t":6.56,"w":"to"},{"t":6.72,"w":"run,"},{"t":6.96,"w":"but"},{"t":7.12,"w":"it"},{"t":7.279,"w":"didn't"},{"t":7.359,"w":"take"},{"t":7.52,"w":"me"},{"t":7.68,"w":"long"},{"t":7.919,"w":"to"},{"t":8.16,"w":"realize"},{"t":8.48,"w":"that"},{"t":8.639,"w":"they"},{"t":8.88,"w":"can"},{"t":9.04,"w":"be"},{"t":9.12,"w":"kind"},{"t":9.28,"w":"of"},{"t":9.36,"w":"difficult"},{"t":9.679,"w":"to"},{"t":9.92,"w":"restart."},{"t":10.88,"w":"And"},{"t":11.04,"w":"one"},{"t":11.2,"w":"of"},{"t":11.28,"w":"the"},{"t":11.44,"w":"reasons"